  "sourceTitle": "Build a voice travel concierge with Amazon Bedrock AgentCore, Managed Knowledge Base and Nova Sonic",
  "sourceBodyHash": "4ed086c29924d859070342715571e146d01db817fcb150f9bfdb063fe2f89ce7",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "groq",
  "requestedModel": "openai/gpt-oss-120b",
  "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-06T19:14:38.303946Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-06T20:23:18.289978Z",
  "totalBlocks": 98,
  "translatedBlocks": 98,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "963e14644cc55bd7",
      "translationZh": "航空公司已经有应用程序和网站，旅客可以在那里查看航班、选择座位和管理预订，而添加自然语音层将这些任务开放给语音请求。有了这个语音层，旅客可以通过说话更改座位或检查延误情况，而无需离开应用程序或浏览屏幕。构建它需要在前几个方面进行仔细的工程处理。你需要双向流式传输音频，并在多轮对话中保持对话的连贯性。你还可以在不紧密耦合代理的情况下访问现有的后端系统，并在假期周末前的流量激增时进行扩展。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e88fc0043c3bb381",
      "translationZh": "本文向你展示如何向航空公司应用程序添加语音旅行礼宾服务，该服务基于三个托管服务构建。Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 是一个代理平台，用于安全地大规模构建、部署和运行 AI 代理，并可选择框架和模型。Bedrock 上的 Amazon Nova Sonic 是一个用于实时语音的语音到语音模型。Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases 是一个完全托管的检索增强生成服务，将答案建立在你的文档之上。旅客说话，礼宾服务会调出他们的行程单，更改座位，更新膳食偏好，回答政策问题，并在请求时将他们连接到人工代理。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b51f590e14175df7",
      "translationZh": "礼宾服务与现有屏幕并行运行，而不是替换它们，因此旅客可以在同一会话中在点击和说话之间切换。它运行在按需扩展的服务上，因此你可以将时间花在体验上，而不是基础设施上。AI 层连接到一个使用合成数据的示例航空公司后端，当你将此模式适配到自己的系统时，这可以加速你的实现。项目分为多个模块，因此你可以重用适合你现有后端的组件，并将它们作为工具暴露给代理。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "73f64d0afb8b50c9",
      "translationZh": "你将学习如何执行以下操作：",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0765deac12eceeb5",
      "translationZh": "使用 AWS Cloud Development Kit (AWS CDK) 在 AWS 上部署语音 AI 礼宾服务。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8d5c6229592bb6ea",
      "translationZh": "使用 Strands Agents 框架和 Amazon Nova 2.5 Sonic 构建用于实时语音的代理，托管在 AgentCore 运行时上，这是 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 框架的一项功能。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f972cb2d9cc042ab",
      "translationZh": "通过 AgentCore Gateway（Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一项功能）使用 Model Context Protocol (MCP) 将代理连接到后端服务。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a2280db767437506",
      "translationZh": "使用 Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases 回答航空公司政策问题。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ec4df2b39d65f096",
      "translationZh": "将旅客转接给真人代理，并提供参考编号和预计等待时间。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c6e3d18fc8f029f9",
      "translationZh": "该架构将前端、AI代理和后端服务分离为不同的层，因此您可以独立开发和扩展每一层。MCP 是将 AI 应用连接到外部工具和数据的开放标准。它在代理和后端之间传递标准化消息，从而保持两者的松散耦合。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0290cbf2f727daac",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案部署了以下服务。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "169130db87a0c3de",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Cognito 处理用户身份验证以及用于签名 API 访问的临时 AWS 凭证。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cdce9dcb6d09c8d7",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 运行时托管代理，每个会话均采用 microVM 隔离。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f47ee56002bec956",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 网关将后端端点公开为可发现的 MCP 工具。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ce41efd203f19059",
      "translationZh": "Amazon API Gateway 将后端发布为 REST 端点，并使用 AWS 身份和访问管理 (IAM) 进行授权。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6bc4cb4bb1d99142",
      "translationZh": "AWS Lambda 运行行程、座位图、乘客更新、航班状态、忠诚度、策略查找和升级的业务逻辑。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "22a80386d8104479",
      "translationZh": "Amazon DynamoDB 存储客户档案、预订、乘客、座位图、购买历史、偏好、对话和航班数据。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6eb8e551f2a4a90e",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock 知识库通过将响应基于您的航空公司政策文档来回答政策问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dc5d1531779a6ee5",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Simple Email Service (Amazon SES) 发送电子邮件通知。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c0c33d6a5205b7bd",
      "translationZh": "AWS Amplify 托管 React 前端。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4674910a50de217",
      "translationZh": "以下图示展示了按四个部分组织的解决方案架构。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f72ee68a5f7ae457",
      "translationZh": "图 1：后端、AgentCore 网关、AgentCore 运行时和前端的端到端架构。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "39a00b5b349219c4",
      "translationZh": "第 A 部分涵盖后端基础设施。五个 CDK 栈部署 DynamoDB 表、Lambda 函数、API Gateway 端点、Amazon Bedrock 知识库和 Amazon Cognito。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0a7d221ca2dc03c",
      "translationZh": "第 B 部分涵盖 AgentCore 网关。一个 CDK 栈创建带有 MCP 协议的 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 网关，并将每个后端端点暴露为代理可按名称调用的工具。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0802476b7c0a691e",
      "translationZh": "C节涵盖了 AgentCore 运行时。两个 CDK 堆栈配置了运行时基础设施。Amazon Elastic Container Registry (Amazon ECR) 存储容器镜像，Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3) 保存源代码上传，而 AWS CodeBuild 生成 ARM64 Docker 镜像。Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 运行时使用 Strands Agents 框架和 Amazon Nova 2.5 Sonic 运行，并支持 WebSocket。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f0be8273ecdc8ea",
      "translationZh": "D部分涵盖前端。一个CDK堆栈在AWS Amplify上部署React应用。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e8a6028d6ad6e022",
      "translationZh": "用户在浏览器或移动设备上打开托管在 AWS Amplify 上的 Web 应用程序。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b6c8e62c11f2ac0b",
      "translationZh": "用户在登录页面上输入他们的凭据。Amazon Cognito 验证请求并返回 JSON Web Tokens (JWTs) 和临时 AWS 凭据。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "76ce33abf93c2298",
      "translationZh": "前端建立了一个 SigV4 签名的 WebSocket 连接，连接到 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 以开始语音礼宾会话。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cf630e94e6a20b92",
      "translationZh": "运行时使用 Amazon Cognito 验证令牌，并通过 Amazon Bedrock 初始化 Amazon Nova 2.5 Sonic。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d34a05f8095d092d",
      "translationZh": "用户发出请求。Amazon Nova 2.5 Sonic 处理音频并触发工具调用。代理通过使用 MCP 调用 AgentCore Gateway 来处理工具集成，以检索航班数据、管理预订并更新乘客偏好。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "57c591baf62b14d0",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore 网关将请求作为 REST API 调用转发到 Amazon API Gateway，后者将它们路由到 AWS Lambda 函数。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f04ed390efdd99ab",
      "translationZh": "AWS Lambda 函数查询 Amazon DynamoDB 表以获取预订、乘客、座位图、忠诚度状态和航班信息。电子邮件通知通过 Amazon SES 发送。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fbc0f0f9c66fca28",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Nova 2.5 Sonic 生成上下文语音响应，并通过 AgentCore 运行时将其通过 WebSocket 连接流式传输回用户。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c003bca118c1baa7",
      "translationZh": "对于策略问题，AgentCore Gateway 通过 MCP Knowledge Base 连接器直接查询 Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Base。知识库将相关策略段落作为引用返回给代理。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d5e0fff62dabb03f",
      "translationZh": "当用户请求人工客服时，AWS Lambda 在 Amazon DynamoDB 中记录升级并返回参考编号。随后 AWS Amplify 触发用户设备发起呼叫，将其连接到人工客服。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42aeef5aa7767ad8",
      "translationZh": "接下来的两个步骤位于实时对话之外。它们描述了解决方案的构建方式以及日常运行方式。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5de13e91777de41f",
      "translationZh": "AWS CDK 使用单个脚本部署解决方案。构建将代理源上传到 Amazon S3，并触发 AWS CodeBuild 生成容器镜像，随后将其存储在 Amazon ECR 中以供 AgentCore 运行时使用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3a1c4c5aebbc8ccc",
      "translationZh": "Amazon CloudWatch 收集所有服务的日志、指标和警报，而 AWS Key Management Service (AWS KMS) 对静态数据进行加密。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e55c202f9a62885f",
      "translationZh": "在开始之前，请确认您已具备以下条件。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a0add1138fbb5089",
      "translationZh": "在您部署的 AWS 区域中，Amazon Bedrock 提供对 Amazon Nova 2.5 Sonic 的模型访问。有关各区域的模型可用性，请参阅 Amazon Bedrock 中的 Supported models by AWS Region。Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases 使用托管的嵌入模型，因此您无需单独获取嵌入模型访问权限。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "48b909bbf5e38122",
      "translationZh": "Node.js 20.x 或更高版本用于 AWS CDK 和 Lambda 函数。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "07fb3036c3a44ddb",
      "translationZh": "Python 3.12 或更高版本用于数据填充和测试客户端。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "40ff938d2a9a53b3",
      "translationZh": "已配置凭证的 AWS Command Line Interface (AWS CLI) 2.x。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b1e0aa0460692d05",
      "translationZh": "通过 npm install -g aws-cdk 安装的 AWS CDK CLI 2.x，以及使用 npx cdk bootstrap 引导的账户。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d390efb85050830c",
      "translationZh": "来自 aws-samples GitHub 仓库的伴随代码。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f18d73f88ad8309d",
      "translationZh": "使用 AWS CDK 部署解决方案",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3da3982c098f18be",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案通过单个 CDK 脚本部署。克隆仓库，配置您的 AWS 凭证，并运行部署脚本。有关详细部署步骤，请参阅 GitHub 仓库中的 README。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "424c86ab3c1e08b6",
      "translationZh": "示例航空公司数据模型",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40158058f39c44bb",
      "translationZh": "API Gateway 发布带有 IAM 授权端点和 Lambda 集成的 REST API。Amazon DynamoDB 以单位毫秒级延迟和按需扩展存储示例航空公司数据模型。数据涵盖客户档案、预订、乘客、座位图、购买历史、偏好、对话记录和航班状态。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f1e2486149667ef8",
      "translationZh": "使用知识库回答政策问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4baaabe1529437ca",
      "translationZh": "旅客询问行李限额、改签费用、宠物旅行和忠诚度条款。该解决方案通过 Amazon Bedrock 知识库使用 Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) 回答这些问题，以您的航空公司政策文件为基础。存储库附带有关行李、取消和退款、改签和重新预订、舱等级规则、忠诚度条款、宠物旅行、特殊援助和升级的示例政策文件。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b50366eaa75f299",
      "translationZh": "您将文档上传到 Amazon S3 并创建知识库一次。此后，Amazon Bedrock 负责其余工作，包括嵌入、分块、索引、存储和检索。存储运行在 Amazon S3 Vectors 上，这是 Amazon S3 的一项功能。Smart Parsing 处理源 PDF，使表格和结构化布局能够准确检索。当您的政策文件发生变更时，您同步知识库，新内容即可立即使用。无需重新部署的流水线。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a93e4bdb704499fa",
      "translationZh": "通过 AgentCore Gateway 将知识库与代理直接连接。您将知识库添加为 Connectors 目标，选择标准或代理式检索，网关将其作为后端 API 工具旁的命名 MCP 工具公开。代理在运行时发现它并按名称调用，无需编写自定义 Lambda 或检索代码。有关设置步骤，请参阅将知识库作为网关目标添加。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "319f6e2477724d02",
      "translationZh": "要使用您自己的政策，请将 PDF 或文本文件放入政策文件夹中，然后重新部署知识库堆栈。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3487f5fe153a0261",
      "translationZh": "使用 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 进行语音 AI 处理",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5788d686d7ae262",
      "translationZh": "每个会话在 AgentCore 运行时以受管理的容器形式运行，并采用 microVM 隔离，在负载下保持旅行者的对话相互独立。AgentCore 提供自动扩展、内置监控和会话路由。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "630af350795f27ac",
      "translationZh": "在生产部署中，添加 Amazon Bedrock Guardrails 以过滤提示注入尝试并验证响应基础。此解决方案中的确认-然后-写入模式会要求旅行者在进行更改前进行确认。该模式以及追溯答案到源文档的知识库引用共同提供了负责任 AI 实践的基线。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55dabcf4444bc7a6",
      "translationZh": "该代理使用 Strands BidiAgents 框架来定义系统提示、工具和对话流程。Amazon Nova 2.5 Sonic 为礼宾服务带来以下功能。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "87ddb8987499227e",
      "translationZh": "跨口音的语音识别以及对背景噪声的鲁棒性。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1bfdb776a243d8ef",
      "translationZh": "能够适应旅行者语气的口头回复。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "31e3525316a2a564",
      "translationZh": "低延迟的双向流。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fdad244ab3c424ed",
      "translationZh": "异步工具调用，能够在不暂停对话的情况下并行获取数据或进行工具调用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "79e27ee170790e56",
      "translationZh": "延迟掩蔽，在等待工具结果时生成临时口头回复，使对话保持自然。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "46646a9155a9b398",
      "translationZh": "插话和自然的轮流交谈。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e23773ec7f5574f4",
      "translationZh": "跨多轮对话保持的上下文。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c15d13e975a1bf40",
      "translationZh": "音频流以 16 kHz PCM 形式从前端通过 WebSocket 传送到 AgentCore runtime。Amazon Nova 2.5 Sonic 将语音转写为文本，代理选择合适的工具，并通过 MCP 调用它们。AgentCore Gateway 将每个 MCP 调用转换为 REST 请求，Lambda 执行逻辑并返回结果，Amazon Nova 2.5 Sonic 将这些结果合成为口头回复。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "32171e1abdfbc74e",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Nova 2.5 Sonic 有哪些新功能",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f804873cab2c0c2",
      "translationZh": "此解决方案使用 Amazon Nova 2.5 Sonic，这是一种具有强大推理能力的实时语音 speech-to-speech 模型。对于需要调用后端工具并遵循详细系统提示的语音礼宾服务，这种推理能力在以下几个实际方面体现：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad68141ad062308b",
      "translationZh": "更好的工具调用和 agentic 任务完成 – 代理能够可靠地在 multi-step 请求中选择并链接合适的工具，例如在一次对话中先查询行程再更改座位。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4cb44edde269f9b",
      "translationZh": "强指令遵循和推理 – 模型紧密遵循 system prompt，包括诸如逐字符朗读确认码和航班号等格式规则。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5d42db4e6a4e1b9",
      "translationZh": "准确的 responsible-AI 处理 – 模型对真实旅客请求给出有帮助的响应，同时安全地处理不适当的请求。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7dc36a8d6ce5f9d6",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案使用 Amazon Cognito 用户池和身份池进行基于角色的访问。旅行者使用用户名和密码登录，并收到 JWT、访问令牌和 ID 令牌。前端将 ID 令牌与 Cognito 身份池交换，以获取由访问密钥、秘密密钥和会话令牌组成的临时 AWS 凭证。这些凭证使用 Signature Version 4 (SigV4) 对 AgentCore 运行时的 WebSocket 连接以及对 API Gateway 的请求进行签名。只有经过身份验证的旅行者才能访问应用程序和服务 API。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a2e881855dfc1263",
      "translationZh": "身份验证和 WebSocket 连接流程",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "57a1fe2fd6940ad3",
      "translationZh": "前端使用临时 AWS 凭证打开到 AgentCore 运行时的 SigV4 签名 WebSocket 连接，并发送访问令牌以进行身份验证。随后，浏览器在同一连接上流式传输 16 kHz PCM 音频，并接收语音响应和工具通知。中间没有服务器端代理。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1f29d1459b7c14a",
      "translationZh": "下图展示了浏览器、Amazon Cognito 与 AgentCore 运行时之间的身份验证和 WebSocket 连接序列。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03220760a5ae2675",
      "translationZh": "图 2：旅行者使用 Amazon Cognito 进行身份验证，浏览器打开到 AgentCore 运行时的 SigV4 签名 WebSocket，Amazon Nova 2.5 Sonic 双向流式传输语音。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c9c650d339adafa3",
      "translationZh": "语音交互和动态工具调用",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a5eeefefa731499c",
      "translationZh": "旅行者请求查看自己的座位。Nova 2.5 Sonic 将请求转录为文本，代理选择所需的工具。它通过 AgentCore Gateway 使用 MCP 并行调用这些工具，网关将每次调用转换为对 API Gateway 的 REST 请求。Lambda 函数查询 DynamoDB 并返回结果，Nova 2.5 Sonic 流式传输包含所有内容的语音响应。由于工具调用以异步方式运行，对话在数据加载过程中不会停滞。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b17fcb7f6463446",
      "translationZh": "下图展示了代理如何处理语音请求并通过 AgentCore Gateway 动态调用后端工具：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b04d2ff44bc7d82a",
      "translationZh": "图 3：语音请求经过 Nova 2.5 Sonic、AgentCore Gateway、API Gateway、Lambda 和 DynamoDB 传输，语音响应则流式返回。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ac6b73f189000ac3",
      "translationZh": "从知识库回答政策问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d4bdbc91e478d90",
      "translationZh": "当旅行者询问行李政策时，代理通过 AgentCore Gateway 使用其原生连接器到达 Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases。知识库使用托管重排器执行代理检索，并以引用形式返回相关政策段落。Nova 2.5 Sonic 生成答案并朗读给旅行者。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "feac1ef2774c2e9f",
      "translationZh": "下图展示了代理通过从 Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases 检索有依据的段落来回答政策问题：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7455b5f205286861",
      "translationZh": "图 4：政策问题由 Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases 回答并朗读给旅行者",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b5705cc536f6495d",
      "translationZh": "升级至人工客服",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8eed216bf4920f85",
      "translationZh": "当礼宾代理无法满足请求或旅行者主动要求时，会将旅行者转接给人工客服。旅行者确认后，代理调用 EscalateToAgent 工具。Lambda 在 DynamoDB 中记录升级情况，并返回带有预估等待时间的参考号。代理共享该参考号，Amplify 前端则拨打支持热线。此示例未包含联络中心应用，因此是否能接通人工取决于您配置的支持号码。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d617565f7396b7b",
      "translationZh": "下图展示了旅行者请求人工客服时的升级流程：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e19c4bdd2f0d0aa",
      "translationZh": "图 5：代理在 DynamoDB 中记录升级，共享参考编号，并且前端将呼叫转接给人工客服。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0a9fefc2fe2f16d4",
      "translationZh": "礼宾服务演练",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2fb929106834aae6",
      "translationZh": "整个对话通过单个 WebSocket 连接免提进行。代理在写入前确认每项更改。它逐字符朗读航班号，以确保清晰可闻，并在后台调用后端工具，因而没有明显延迟。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd825bb71edc8548",
      "translationZh": "为了停止产生费用，请删除已部署的资源。先预览删除内容，然后执行清理。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c5c9d6f08734008",
      "translationZh": "脚本按相反顺序销毁资源，先是前端，然后是 AgentCore 运行时、AgentCore 网关，最后是后端基础设施。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d837b66657d7e8aa",
      "translationZh": "本文展示了如何在 AWS 上构建语音旅行礼宾服务。它使用 Amazon Cognito 进行身份验证，使用 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 进行代理托管，使用 API Gateway 和 Lambda 处理业务逻辑，使用 DynamoDB 进行存储，使用 Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases 提供政策答案。分层设计将前端、代理和后端分离，使每部分能够独立开发和扩展。礼宾服务通过 MCP 工具管理行程、座位变更、餐食偏好、航班状态、忠诚度问题、政策查询以及人工客服升级。Amazon Nova 2.5 Sonic 带来低延迟语音、并行工具调用和自然的中断处理。按使用付费的定价和自动扩展使成本随流量变化，并且通过 MCP 集成，您可以在不修改代理代码的情况下添加新的 Lambda 函数。要开始使用，请访问 GitHub 上的解决方案仓库，并根据您自己的航空系统进行调整。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9dc0958145456e95",
      "translationZh": "使用 Amazon Nova Sonic 语音到语音模型",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "206d3edaff93de39",
      "translationZh": "开始使用 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "530a8364a883fb10",
      "translationZh": "模型上下文协议规范",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e6d18f130fc3124b",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock 知识库",
      "provider": "groq",
